---
---
<section class="isnad-dilemma-new" aria-labelledby="isnad-dilemma-title">
    <div class="dilemma-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">Transmission Criticism</span>
        <h2 id="isnad-dilemma-title">The Isnād Dilemma</h2>
        <p>When five hundred witnesses become one chain.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dilemma-cards">
        <!-- Card 1: Analogy -->
        <div class="dilemma-card analogy-card">
            <div class="card-head">
                <span class="icon">✦</span>
                <div class="titles">
                    <span class="label">Analogy</span>
                    <h3>Courtroom Scenario</h3>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="quote-box">
                <span class="quote-label">Witness Testifies</span>
                <blockquote>“Your Honor, five hundred people saw the defendant commit the crime.”</blockquote>
            </div>
            <div class="logic-flow">
                <div class="node source-node">
                    <span class="val">1</span>
                    <span class="desc">Witness</span>
                </div>
                <div class="operator">+</div>
                <div class="node claim-node">
                    <span class="val">500</span>
                    <span class="desc">Hearsay Claims</span>
                </div>
                <div class="operator">=</div>
                <div class="node result-node">
                    <span class="val">1</span>
                    <span class="desc">Legal Witness</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2: Resurrection -->
        <div class="dilemma-card resurrection-card">
            <div class="card-head">
                <span class="icon">◈</span>
                <div class="titles">
                    <span class="label">Historical Claim</span>
                    <h3>The Resurrection</h3>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="quote-box">
                <span class="quote-label">Paul Writes</span>
                <blockquote>“Christ appeared to more than five hundred brothers at once.”</blockquote>
            </div>
            <div class="logic-flow">
                <div class="node source-node">
                    <span class="val">1</span>
                    <span class="desc">Source (Paul)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="operator">+</div>
                <div class="node claim-node">
                    <span class="val">500</span>
                    <span class="desc">Unverified Attestations</span>
                </div>
                <div class="operator">=</div>
                <div class="node result-node">
                    <span class="val">1</span>
                    <span class="desc">Historical Chain</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dilemma-irony">
        <div class="irony-icon">◇</div>
        <div class="irony-content">
            <h4>The Methodological Irony</h4>
            <p>Christian polemicists dismiss isnād criticism as too demanding for ancient history, yet their own central claim fails even this basic standard. The number sounds massive, but the evidence still comes through one single recoverable source.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .isnad-dilemma-new {
        margin: 3rem 0;
        padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(216, 177, 102, 0.05), transparent 70%),
                    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20, 19, 18, 0.8), rgba(15, 15, 16, 0.95));
        border: 1px solid var(--hc-rule);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        color: var(--hc-parchment);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    .dilemma-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .eyebrow {
        display: block;
        color: var(--hc-gold);
        font-family: var(--font-ui);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .dilemma-header h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--hc-gold-soft);
        line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .dilemma-header p {
        margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
        color: var(--hc-muted);
        font-style: italic;
    }

    .dilemma-cards {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .dilemma-card {
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--hc-surface-2) 70%, transparent);
        border: 1px solid var(--hc-rule-soft);
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .analogy-card {
        border-left: 3px solid var(--hc-gold);
    }

    .resurrection-card {
        border-left: 3px solid #d76b5f;
    }

    .card-head {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hc-rule-soft);
        padding-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .icon {
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        background: rgba(216, 177, 102, 0.1);
        color: var(--hc-gold);
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--hc-rule);
    }

    .resurrection-card .icon {
        color: #d76b5f;
        background: rgba(215, 107, 95, 0.1);
        border-color: rgba(215, 107, 95, 0.3);
    }

    .titles .label {
        display: block;
        color: var(--hc-ash);
        font-family: var(--font-ui);
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
    }

    .titles h3 {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--hc-text-primary);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .quote-box {
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .quote-label {
        display: inline-block;
        color: var(--hc-gold-dim);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .quote-box blockquote {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--hc-text-primary);
        font-style: italic;
    }

    .logic-flow {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--hc-surface-3) 50%, transparent);
        padding: 1rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
        border: 1px solid var(--hc-rule-strong);
    }

    .operator {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        color: var(--hc-gold-dim);
        margin: 0 0.5rem;
    }

    .node {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        background: rgba(216, 177, 102, 0.05);
        border: 1px solid var(--hc-rule);
        border-radius: 6px;
        min-width: 120px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .node .val {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        color: var(--hc-gold-soft);
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1;
        margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .node .desc {
        font-family: var(--font-ui);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--hc-muted);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .result-node {
        background: rgba(216, 177, 102, 0.15);
        border-color: var(--hc-gold);
    }

    .result-node .val {
        color: var(--hc-gold);
    }

    .resurrection-card .result-node {
        background: rgba(215, 107, 95, 0.15);
        border-color: #d76b5f;
    }
    
    .resurrection-card .result-node .val {
        color: #d76b5f;
    }

    .dilemma-irony {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        background: rgba(216, 177, 102, 0.03);
        border: 1px solid var(--hc-rule);
        border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .irony-icon {
        font-size: 2rem;
        color: var(--hc-gold);
        line-height: 1;
        margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }

    .irony-content h4 {
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
        color: var(--hc-gold-soft);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    .irony-content p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: var(--hc-muted);
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
        .logic-flow {
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
        }
        
        .operator {
            transform: rotate(90deg);
            margin: 0;
        }

        .node {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .dilemma-irony {
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
        }
    }
</style>
